        "created_at": "2022-04-30T18:34:48.348Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Greetings, forumites.</p>\n<p>On GTG’s webstore’s <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/product/sentinel-comics-the-role-playing-game-core-rulebook/\">page for the <em><strong>Core Rulebook</strong></em></a>, there were originally free, form-fillable PDFs for the Villain Character Sheet, Hero Character Sheet, and Auxiliary Sheet.</p>\n<p>However, it appears that when GTG updated their website, those files were lost and are no longer available to download from that page.</p>\n<p>So, has anyone saved a copy of those files that they can share? If not, can <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/bailey\">@bailey</a> provide them (and/or get them back on that page)?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-04-30T18:34:48.348Z",
